{"version":1,"content":"<p>由劉雅麗﹑盧頌恩（妹頭）﹑梁嘉琪﹑張錦霞等主演的舞台喜劇《辦公室劇后》，前天正式公演，視后佘詩曼現身撐場。</p><p>不過今天（25日）劇團 Why Show Serious宣布，原定於今天下午3時上演之劇目《辦公室劇后》，由於主要演員之一的妹頭突發失聲病倒，團方經審慎考慮後，決定將今日下午3時場次延期舉行。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:05.703433+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T04:23:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:09.066700+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.798660+00:00","content_hash":"9fdbd6573c33d4a470a1d5ff6d85270b94d35d12cf433f92fd177cf14a0f17dc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}